### Client-Side Rendering

The above component, which the client side renderers refer to is represented as follows:

````php
<?php

    require_once 'Java/Loader.php';
    Java_Loader::loadClass('com/openx/xservicemag/Module');

    module ('Java');
    f() ();

?>

````
This file provides access to the `Module` class
which loads the Java `com.openx.xservicemad.x.XRequest` class

````java
